{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c182a65f60003d565186953abbf0fa3a90be65efc1e00ca3f3465a0a0b186eab", "ja": "初センター公演を控え、明るくレッスンに励\nんでいた恵美。実はセンターのプレッシャー\nに苦しんでいたのだが、可憐や仲間たち、そ\nしてプロデューサーの気遣いに助けられ、無\n事に公演を成功させる。", "zh": "面对即将来临的第一次Center公演，\n惠美总是表现出开朗的态度努力练习。\n但其实，担任Center的压力一直让她很苦恼。\n不过在可怜、伙伴们以及制作人的鼓舞下，\n公演终于顺利落幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1000_p", "source_sha256": "54e987f0c4ea86b3cb4543f66ca57284887a85c3e71bf40b6ab3d52e90f4f31f", "ja": "（次の公演のセンターは恵美に決まった。\nレッスンも始まったけど、調子はどうかな……）", "zh": "（下次公演的Center决定由惠美担任。\n现在大家已经开始练习，不知道状况如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "3f672bf4d66bb3a8cf58759dfc43b13f5afe2e5f13324eb4b73586cb9f11aec3", "ja": "わん、つー、すりー、ふぉー！\n恵美ちゃん、遅れてるのですよ！", "zh": "1、2、3、4！\n小惠美，你动作慢了唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "e072b43e9f58c6b5cbd0a79b81de1791cf0ff70b5d41ae8f6c2425e9f78a1b6e", "ja": "わ、わかってるってば～！\n足がついてこないんだって……ううっ。", "zh": "我、我知道啦～！\n但脚就是跟不上……唔唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "6658c34326e09811a1c102149f2eaec1bff24e34ae7bee5ead2b01bec26ac752", "ja": "メグミ、難しく考えない方がいいヨ～。\nリズムに合わせて……ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー♪", "zh": "惠美，你不要想得太复杂～\n只要跟着节奏……1、2、3、4♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "818e7f800b086832c7855d5e2f24e662c927c9c054b5e4c83a9787335d0339f7", "ja": "ねっ？　こんなカンジでやればいいんだヨ♪\nあっ、手と足は、指先まで意識してネ！", "zh": "懂吗？像这样跳就可以啰♪\n啊，要连手指头跟脚趾头的动作都注意到喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "90b90f9b37d07d97912fb62413e200b5a78e941e9097158dd0547253fb6933f5", "ja": "うぅ……まつりもエレナも、簡単に言ってくれるな～。\nえーっと……ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー！", "zh": "唔唔……茉莉和艾琳娜说得好像很简单～\n嗯……1、2、3、4！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "3382a92f1a80465a1bc3e3346a2350acae8cafd199705eee32e06ef20bc735a0", "ja": "そうそう、恵美ちゃん、いい感じなのです♪\nこの調子で、ぱわほー！にいくのですよー！", "zh": "没错没错，小惠美，跳得很不错的唷♪\n就这样保持下去，然后拿出更强大的力道唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1007_p", "source_sha256": "45806bfa2c98e8753331b14b6e3c93da946982c82f5f483f2c186dc67b3717c2", "ja": "お疲れさま、みんな。頑張ってるみたいだな！", "zh": "大家辛苦了，看来你们很努力在练习呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "198b9cc6bcf1ef39089bf3d0b37dc28a68ea23d4fa3a2b643d43f5b1cdcb6c93", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nもー聞いてよ、超タイヘンなんだから～！", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}。\n欸～你听我说，练习实在超辛苦的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "d746e8f9d4ef83f5174ab31fe1c49a9c3dba92b3610a03ce219d6fe67369046c", "ja": "{$P$}さんが来たなら、\n仕方がないのです。みんな、休憩にしましょー！", "zh": "既然{$P$}先生来了，\n那也没办法了唷。各位，我们休息一下吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "af64938594703659194192763fcc625ad1a97aadfd53bd3787b343b4148cd922", "ja": "ハーイっ♪　ティータイムだネっ。\nドリンク、ドリンク♪", "zh": "好～♪下午茶时间！\n饮料、饮料♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "57132699d45f6033b868051c4524b2f0e5ce49577cad83fe89c78ac7a8d12ec6", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\nアタシ達のレッスン、どうだった？", "zh": "问你喔，{$P$}。\n你觉得我们练习得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5268469e647cb90edf6da282a48b831595aa26ec89819cf50303f833e9e22b5a", "ja": "順調そうに見えたけど……何か問題があるのか？", "zh": "看起来很顺利……有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "68557e229925f1ebfd98378f804eeb7de7828b1615a446318e65e19386bc7454", "ja": "{$P$}さんも言ってください。\n恵美ちゃんは、心配性過ぎるのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也帮忙劝劝她吧。\n小惠美太爱操心了唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "9e4a7ec8ab4a112f70d83afd68ff9519083d6a4a1ee0f2dec03fa5067f58375f", "ja": "恵美ちゃんのセンターを楽しみにしている人だって、\nいるのですよ？　もっと堂々とするのです！", "zh": "一定也有人很期待小惠美当Center喔。\n要对自己更有自信一点的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "2045eae9f44ace3af50ebe65479e53b175cfb77f8499cb098377ab48aba2f6a8", "ja": "そ、そうなんだけどさ～。\nちゃんとできるか、自信なくって……。", "zh": "是、是这样没错啦～\n但我还是没自信，不知道自己做不做得来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1017_p", "source_sha256": "016fc7d60b8ef1293c694fcc3b21ba93ed6c806c70a4b905237a9e81705c4ae9", "ja": "そうだな……恵美は自分がセンターのライブを、\nどんなライブにしたいと思ってる？", "zh": "这样啊……惠美想把自己的Center公演，\n打造成什么样的演唱会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "64a8c990524080fcfc2f4178ac5543d9f4c1448cbe0d950981e3d4a9a565d68e", "ja": "へっ？　ど、どんなライブ……？\nんー、そこは特に考えてなかったかな……。", "zh": "咦？什、什么样的演唱会……？\n嗯～我倒是没有特别想到那里去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "00bcb150366c87d4b5f6a392433b894f89fb2be729ff0bf0817912b06c4d026d", "ja": "あ、でも、盛り上がるライブにしたいと思ってるよ！\nやっぱお客さん達には、楽しんでほしいし……。", "zh": "啊，不过我想打造一场气氛非常热烈的演唱会！\n毕竟还是希望观众能开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "dbf00cd35d5f49115791ff8bdff1d79ad16e7bc9721f2a715e2095df231a0727", "ja": "って、アタシなんかにできるかどうか、\nわからないけどさっ。あはは……。", "zh": "话是这么说，我也不知道自己办不办得到啦。\n啊哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1021_p", "source_sha256": "29aa2edcf3d12134092e190b2f22f9c8c4d18a5bfca74ee5e5906f71edb333b6", "ja": "いや、いい目標じゃないかな。\nステージを楽しんでもらう事が、一番大事だから。", "zh": "不会啊，这是个很棒的目标。\n让观众能享受表演是最重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "693603266d997b663cc907dfd8bf154f8615d2125e78962d4d526fd8f3090a89", "ja": "そうなのです。恵美ちゃん、もっと自信を持つのです。\nね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "就是说呀。小惠美，要对自己有自信一点的喔。\n呐，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7bd01a598b9c7d2ed878c47979dd30fa8456906d0a44d20a21c9e75f2d0a0cfe", "ja": "ああ、今回は恵美がセンターなんだし、\nどんどん前に出ていった方がいい。", "zh": "嗯，而且惠美是这次的Center，\n可以尽量表现自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "d0b22cfcba206b3ca8422bbfa48d803e485f227e3d370f2b2c30975a4b37f701", "ja": "前にか～……。そだね、あんまり得意じゃないけど、\nアタシなりに頑張ってみるよ。", "zh": "表现自己啊……也是，虽然我不是很擅长，\n但我会尽力试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1025_018ele", "source_sha256": "f3520c8d40797abe94d613d396a7e9be626a69153f7a07fb8b6faaba6630d354", "ja": "メグミ、きっと大丈夫だヨ！\nお客さんもワタシ達も、楽しいのが1番だって思うナ。", "zh": "惠美，你一定没问题的！\n不管是观众还是我们，最重要的就是开心享受表演嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "1d2cf522f2ad061975d110a0b50367d83828424d0d6eab6b13b5b229ee283bf0", "ja": "それに、ワタシ達のダンスを見たら、\nお客さん達だって、踊りたくなっちゃうハズだヨっ♪", "zh": "而且观众看到我们的舞蹈，\n一定也会想一起跳舞唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "4c02bb869fa3b4bb97796b5a7e882928ae1015f375cd3b0fa3d6044e4d1e8853", "ja": "にゃははは、みんながノリノリで\n踊っちゃうライブか～。いいね、それ♪", "zh": "呀哈哈哈，大家一起开心跳舞的演唱会啊～\n听起来很不错呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "3f5bbc59fa1744ee480b1b2b6cd90f5a47a038fab6d401bbf43bb3c6c576306b", "ja": "そうと決まれば、レッツダンスだヨ！\nメグミ、マツリ！　ワタシについてきてっ♪", "zh": "既然决定了，就Let's dance吧！\n惠美、茉莉！跟着我的脚步一起跳♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "e3db15365adfda6596dba3c1374895256b5f74521157164cb03b82c57ca7e80a", "ja": "はいほー！　休憩は、終わりなのです。\nノリノリなライブ目指して、レッスン再開なのです！", "zh": "Hi Ho──！休息时间结束了唷。\n为了打造一场欢乐的演唱会，大家继续练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "96ccd1148ae91133e59128161f99d84038df4f3e89e105ef98a7e6b6fe4fbc16", "ja": "ンー、ダンス楽しかったネ！\nレッスン、あっという間に終わっちゃったヨ～。", "zh": "嗯～跳舞真开心！\n练习时间一下就结束了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1032_020meg", "source_sha256": "fa26884ee3c908185f5c33b80a30f576a414819308815e4c79a467b14a3b5d69", "ja": "はぁ……もう、エレナには敵わないなぁ～。\nアタシは、ついていくのがやっとだったっての！", "zh": "呼……真是太佩服艾琳娜了～\n我光是要跟上她就已经快累瘫了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "94bab744c4814ff6ed7e8eb83dbf5a7cd20bbe9362d0bd39e79ab6c49b75ed93", "ja": "でも、いい感じになってきたのです。\nこの調子で、本番まで頑張りましょー！", "zh": "不过小惠美跳得越来越好了唷。\n就照这个步调，一起努力到正式表演那天吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "12fa60a7149d4732a66d1ccaaa097f9a1f5602c0f4caf68167c044dccfca1426", "ja": "イェーイ！", "zh": "耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1035_p", "source_sha256": "af2e1417beac3820c3e8c8aebd29335e1b3b925c72adc30d14a5335b9c4c9272", "ja": "（終始、笑顔の絶えないレッスンだった。\nこの調子なら、本番も……）", "zh": "（练习过程中，大家从头到尾都带着笑容。\n照这样下去，正式表演应该也……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "ca66890221f2baed11abe84b29d9fb7ef95a6b8fec36d2d6d86b684f2d3a5af2", "ja": "…………はぁ。", "zh": "…………唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1037_p", "source_sha256": "be7e4103217dd2ad639a22f4de4bec211bb4d003035b06f44d697b5d5ee07246", "ja": "？　恵美？", "zh": "惠美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1038_020meg", "source_sha256": "56f9f94a82bbb40b7a3d94afdd073cd7fe59f3670dc4b452d9e6de559c033ca9", "ja": "え？　{$P$}、どしたの？\n何か、ヘンな顔してない？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}，怎么了吗？\n为什么你的表情那么奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f5791baf9fbceeef5f64a8efd4f4dd66ca15a980c474d4309d64d7b1289e1616", "ja": "ヘンな顔……いや、俺の顔の話はいいから。\nそれより恵美、もしかして疲れてるのか？", "zh": "表情奇怪……不对，我的表情不重要。\n先别说这个，惠美你是不是累了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1040_020meg", "source_sha256": "643ecad43ba38b21081d8fa2b887f5e683f2bf538b873467910e0d8363cdca55", "ja": "アタシ？　あは、確かにちょっと疲れたけど、\nダイジョブだよ。お水飲んだら、復活したしね。", "zh": "我吗？啊哈，确实是有点累，不过没问题。\n喝过水以后就复活了啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1041_p", "source_sha256": "a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c", "ja": "でも……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1042_018ele", "source_sha256": "55a5bd21d96e08f4a8e6cde15ff0c826bb1bf965e041f126d083b5ae6cb274fb", "ja": "メグミー！", "zh": "惠美──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1043_018ele", "source_sha256": "9bda0f2c9f3f3612893982b5f874b0a99c70b89b9fa923be2cd01ec73962b29d", "ja": "ワタシとマツリはそろそろ帰るけど、\nメグミはどうする？", "zh": "我和茉莉差不多要回家了，\n惠美呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "3d2d8e3c785a15947f77b3eebb0dda4c7457773a1a4dad86e8af0248c9c7d060", "ja": "あ、じゃあアタシも……。", "zh": "啊，那我也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1045_p", "source_sha256": "c8da3bea101a614019f4bf3a555123a05df0abc24deef86a124facdfbf23d5c0", "ja": "いや、恵美はちょっと用事があるから残ってくれ。\nふたりとも、お疲れさま！", "zh": "等等，我有事要跟惠美说，所以麻烦你留下来。\n辛苦你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1046_020meg", "source_sha256": "746ce2d3eadaefef4c6c38d8e0145f729a788c63babd9785a410da12a5353a45", "ja": "えっ？　あ、う、うん……。", "zh": "咦？啊，嗯、嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "70040890850965dc1187017923dc78785dc82c95da25391cf380ccc7fadb40bd", "ja": "わかったヨー。じゃあワタシとマツリは先に帰るネ。\nメグミ、{$P$}、バイバーイ！", "zh": "好～那我和茉莉先回家啰。\n惠美、{$P$}，拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1048_021mat", "source_sha256": "0257d328cb954b8e77a00c63a037381048273e3583c49e4dee58a0c219bc2d19", "ja": "恵美ちゃん、{$P$}さん、\nまた明日なのです♪", "zh": "小惠美、{$P$}先生，\n我们明天见唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1049_020meg", "source_sha256": "263a6ad59758004bc8d1d3e543905bbc888601e60fb80f289327dc8b45b7e255", "ja": "うん、また明日！　ふたりとも、\nレッスン付き合ってくれてありがとね～！", "zh": "嗯，明天见！\n谢谢你们陪我一起练习～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1050_020meg", "source_sha256": "0fa2e0a4db3d2fdf7b57daa407776beae0f523bc9c0af71c7d14d9348dc162cd", "ja": "……で、{$P$}。\nアタシに用事って、何？", "zh": "……所以，{$P$}？\n你找我有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1051_p", "source_sha256": "a66bcba95c4a30c350b3aac63ce28828f06e357121a8b0ab30f82bea8a9687fd", "ja": "そうだな。\nその前に……ちょっと場所を移そうか。", "zh": "这个嘛，在进入主题之前……\n我们换个地方聊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1053_020meg", "source_sha256": "e77ab023c3673490b288d38a40cb7ceaa322f86bcf4313b9347a7c56c9e08ff6", "ja": "たっだいま～。って、まだ家じゃなかったね！\nにゃはははは。", "zh": "我回来啰～哎呀，还没到家呢！\n呀哈哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1054_020meg", "source_sha256": "8131b32dd0376e109fb032180bd3afaa70a464532211789d2e82499e66924f27", "ja": "ん？　でもアタシ達アイドルにとって、劇場は\nホームっていうよね。つまり、家みたいなもの……？", "zh": "嗯？不过对我们偶像来说，剧场算是我们的据点对吧？\n所以就像家一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1055_020meg", "source_sha256": "8e630ae014f3680eb05318870ee1264c4867a2c173a432fc54822947ff19bb7f", "ja": "それじゃやっぱり、ただいまでよかったのかもね！\nなんか、いい匂いして落ち着くし！　にゃははは……。", "zh": "这样「我回来啰」果然没说错呢！\n总觉得有股好香的味道，让人好放松！呀哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1056_p", "source_sha256": "3cba0ba7ff5a0d0de718975656e83a4278a0022b083fb8ce48cd3a2110382608", "ja": "恵美……。", "zh": "惠美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1057_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae2c279fd96822db2cd2dbd45e837f7a3ac22984387f03d16fa21eb3519461bb", "ja": "な、なに？　どしたの、{$P$}。\nアタシの顔、何かついてる？", "zh": "什、什么？怎么了，{$P$}？\n我脸上有沾到什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1058_p", "source_sha256": "dc25f4b33c24e989315d4912a21befc5df157b2e0c30db25f1bba8382778a306", "ja": "恵美、本当に大丈夫なのか？\n何か心配なことがあるなら、遠慮なく言ってほしい。", "zh": "惠美，你真的还好吗？\n如果有什么担心的事，希望你尽管说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1059_020meg", "source_sha256": "1ffcb4c12559b6a4ea85e186eb7b7be30d37b1d291ed4b52e48a4cf3a4071eae", "ja": "え？　やだな、そんなマジになっちゃって～。\n心配なコトなんて、別に……何もないって。", "zh": "咦？讨厌啦，干嘛突然那么严肃～\n我根本……没有在担心什么啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1060_p", "source_sha256": "182c986444c24b657be0d00db9a5ee1abfbaba3c5cdd2ccb7c417fd1ee75aa9b", "ja": "なら、どうして目を逸らすんだ？", "zh": "那你为什么眼神闪烁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1061_020meg", "source_sha256": "2d2093e3a10496a1130ab4011ac85c95eae0720791b15e8ed933344d0c8991d7", "ja": "う……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1062_045kar", "source_sha256": "4064049aa273175e1072d5b718af028c1ab2a4415d70725c6cc259b46eae6d86", "ja": "あ……お、お帰りなさい、恵美ちゃん、\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊……欢、欢迎回来，惠美、\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1063_020meg", "source_sha256": "7dcfb58f421eec39a7ade1c7a3417053ae13dc25d72ac0df158a17011541bb15", "ja": "え？　あ、可憐……。", "zh": "咦？啊，可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1064_p", "source_sha256": "9b1ce9109b6ff46522257584f166e745fcd39fec1531fa58fd0bbcd370915c24", "ja": "可憐、お疲れさま。\n仕事はもう、終わったのか？", "zh": "可怜，辛苦了。\n你的工作结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1065_045kar", "source_sha256": "4d6ef245950d4aa4f2308a58dc2c03e911d4510912d182448ebaa43f3d169936", "ja": "は、はい、なんとか……。あの、め、恵美ちゃん……\nこの後、時間あるかな……？", "zh": "是、是的，总算完成了……那个，惠、惠美……\n你等一下有空吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1066_020meg", "source_sha256": "33079b47cbb1b44151ee7c6d0de4096e6597e6ece0e558e62dda6a42534d25bb", "ja": "アタシ？　うん、{$P$}と\n話をする以外、特に用事はないけど……。", "zh": "我？嗯，除了和{$P$}\n谈事情之外，没什么其他安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1067_045kar", "source_sha256": "1c79e5f58884b2110c79fcb21961d58b713fa29c8a0904e5307d7a22c843a056", "ja": "よかった……。あ、あのね……家から、\nは、ハーブティー、持ってきたんだ……♪", "zh": "太好了……那、那个……\n我从家里带了花、花草茶来……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1068_045kar", "source_sha256": "df817bba13c51a1bb44f207af23f4acc9b8ac2534f24ad068ae8a04b821b1015", "ja": "よかったら……一緒に、お茶でもどうかなって……。\n{$P$}さんも、よかったら……。", "zh": "不介意的话……要不要一起喝茶……？\n{$P$}先生不嫌弃的话也请用……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1069_p", "source_sha256": "c7d5fbbb863f0a36099e387dec56e2091006dbb06c238ef6165d6707d69c1bc4", "ja": "ありがとう。\nせっかくだから、いただこうかな。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n难得有这个机会，那就麻烦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1070_020meg", "source_sha256": "52aca8a2e507f6ce367de78f5b6d4184e221ff75c7207e13cb3d1c6473a7024f", "ja": "ハーブティー……って、アタシに？", "zh": "花草茶……要泡给我喝吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1071_045kar", "source_sha256": "53925148083cd6f079445fdcbb32c53abb2ab2468c322eebcecc59f5aa9cc486", "ja": "うん……か、カモミールと、ペパーミントの、\nブレンド……疲労回復の、効果があるから……。", "zh": "嗯……洋、洋甘菊加上薄荷……\n有消除疲劳的效果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1072_045kar", "source_sha256": "d3b9ca8f3be9417ac2aadbfe46db10e3b1284afec5ca305963812c0adf583079", "ja": "これで……レッスンの疲れ、少しでも……\nと、取れるといいな、って……。", "zh": "希望……你喝了以后，多少能……\n让练习后的疲劳舒缓一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1073_020meg", "source_sha256": "f7edcf525e2dc2554269351dc5fd03102516e32c0194c6b59dc8ca515d0402bd", "ja": "へ～、そうなんだ！　あ、もしかしてそれ？\nさっきから、いい匂いしてるのって。", "zh": "哦～原来是这样～啊，该不会就是因为这个，\n我才会从刚刚就一直闻到很香的味道？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1074_045kar", "source_sha256": "2922a1f99f085105f41fac4818bad5528fc008f013342b83d7bf6612dd88aa41", "ja": "う、うん……。\nえっと、迷惑……だったかな……？", "zh": "嗯……\n那个，造成你的……困扰了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1075_020meg", "source_sha256": "de5a29440ccc877d0e6dce4f1ea870cb2f4dc418c3e6485b2900e3140557c054", "ja": "迷惑なワケないって！　可憐、アタシのために\n持ってきてくれたんでしょ？　ありがと！", "zh": "怎么会觉得困扰！\n可怜，你是特别带来给我的吧？谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1076_045kar", "source_sha256": "430d6eb29aba60a52c9b5f9306367f7e8a799a5bfd56e069cd6b6e46a0fccc05", "ja": "えへへ……よ、よかった……。わ、私、エレナさんと\n違って、ダンスはそこまで得意じゃないから……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……太、太好了……\n我、我和艾琳娜不同，不太擅长跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1077_045kar", "source_sha256": "b8889665546594a5e075ac67c12290dce9075db214771cf6704ef0bf3f0eb466", "ja": "他のことで、何か……め、恵美ちゃんの役に\n立てたらって……考えたんだ……♪", "zh": "所以我才在想……有没有什么……\n可、可以帮忙惠美的地方……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1078_020meg", "source_sha256": "4fa45085a3f0f280d6da693a243429eaf263fabc4ba46a5d171c7109bff8eb3d", "ja": "可憐……なんでそんなに、\nアタシなんかのこと心配してくれるの……？", "zh": "可怜……\n你为什么这么关心我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1079_045kar", "source_sha256": "38e6fe0469caa037b8230cdc961d8c32d1dd281f38d041d61f49aaca56db7042", "ja": "え？　だ、だって……。恵美ちゃんこそ、私のこと……\nいつも、励ましてくれるでしょ……？", "zh": "咦？因、因为……惠美也……\n总是一直鼓励我……不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
