{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1081_045kar", "source_sha256": "4a876d0a96789cdd99dfe5d8fc521100ef4dad99cc3e932e8bc98769dac8383b", "ja": "だから……わ、私も、ちょっとくらい、\n何かできたら……お、お返しになるかなって……てへ。", "zh": "所以……我、我想说如果我也能帮上你的忙……\n多、多少就可以回报你了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1083_020meg", "source_sha256": "257ae19b2a729119eb539221cb7b39b04e07eee0f536713265645957e15a792f", "ja": "もう……なん、で……っ。", "zh": "真是的……为什、么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
