{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1088_020meg", "source_sha256": "42f8f53f9bda254532d434a60084918ab290266be21b9d780cae304fa80d387d", "ja": "ハーブティーのいい匂いで、気が緩んじゃったのかな？\nふたりともごめんね、今のナシ！　何も見なかった！", "zh": "大概是因为花草茶的香味让我放松下来了吧？\n抱歉，刚刚那不算数！你们就当没看到吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_012_1089", "source_sha256": "826ec36fdfcd23e25327a0ad751edb8d2a3f766c292872993bf68a2a84bcee7b", "ja": "無理するな", "zh": "不要勉强自己", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
